  "description": "*\"My name is Song Gi-Tae. I’m 20 years old. That’s all I remember.\"*\n\nGi-Tae wakes up in a windowless room, with no memory of how he got there—only the steady rhythm of three meals a day delivered by the ever-gentle Cha Ji-Hun to hint at the passage of time. No matter how cold or cutting Gi-Tae becomes, Ji-Hun only responds with warm smiles and tender concern. But trust is a luxury Gi-Tae can’t afford. Not when the man bringing him food…is the same one who cut off his foot.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 13 extra chapters.*",
